WEBVTT

00:03:28.162 --> 00:03:31.707
My therapist once jokingly said
that I needed to pick a struggle.

00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:36.254
(Laughter)

00:03:36.587 --> 00:03:38.256
All of this is to say,

00:03:38.297 --> 00:03:44.637
I really want to create a better
transition process for young people,

00:03:44.637 --> 00:03:49.058
because I truly believe
that the more we talk about sex,

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:52.144
the safer and the better
it'll be for everybody.

00:03:52.728 --> 00:03:58.317
(Applause)

00:03:58.359 --> 00:03:59.986
So in 2016,

00:03:59.986 --> 00:04:05.283
I started a sex-positive podcast
called "The Spread."